  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Higher coordinated diplomatic cohesion among sanctioning states increases the probability of collective export restrictions or embargoes (and enforcement), tightening supply access and lifting crude futures price levels.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
