  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Tighter, unified diplomatic messaging among transatlantic partners reduces ambiguity about the timing and scope of sanctions, trade measures and regulatory steps, lowering perceived policy unpredictability for firms and investors.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
