  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.9</data>
  <data key="d36">Rapid increases in weapons deliveries and operational support force governments to approve emergency defense appropriations and supplemental spending, shifting the fiscal stance more expansionary.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">transatlantic_cohesion</data>
