  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">A spike in maritime attacks raises perceived geopolitical and trade risk for shipping‑exposed and EM assets, prompting rapid portfolio rebalancing and sudden cross‑border outflows that increase capital‑flow volatility in transatlantic markets.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_gulf_escalation</data>
