  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Increased naval presence (inspections, convoying, blockades or restricted zones) mechanically lengthens transit times and forces rerouting, producing measurable disruptions and delays at strategic chokepoints.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_gulf_escalation</data>
