  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Reallocation of US/Allied naval and logistical assets and escorts to the Gulf reduces lift, port access prioritization and operational bandwidth for transatlantic transfers of heavy equipment, slowing the rate at which major weapons and platforms are committed to Ukraine.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_gulf_escalation</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
