  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Visible increases in allied naval deployments force governments into contested decisions over military posture, sanctions and convoy rules, heightening perceived unpredictability about future public‑policy choices among transatlantic actors.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_gulf_escalation</data>
  <data key="d39">transatlantic_cohesion</data>
