  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained drops in throughput delay delivery of GPUs, accelerators and prebuilt servers to cloud providers and enterprises, slowing rollouts of transaction‑capable and edge AI agents and reducing near‑term agent deployment prevalence.</data>
