  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising shipping and insurance costs feed into higher import prices and add supply‑side and risk premia for trade‑dependent economies, leading investors to demand higher long‑term sovereign yields.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">iran_gulf_escalation</data>
  <data key="d39">transatlantic_cohesion</data>
