  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">An increase in non-Gulf global crude supply reduces buyers' dependence on Gulf cargoes, leading refiners and traders to divert contracts away from routes through regional choke points and thereby lower throughput.</data>
