<edge source="global_oil_rebalance::chokepoint_disruption" target="comms_cyber_warfare::compute_infra_utilizatio" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Heightened chokepoint disruptions delay or block shipments of specialized compute hardware, spare parts and cooling equipment and prevent on‑site repairs, forcing data centers and AI operators to idle capacity and defer workload ramp‑ups.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_oil_rebalance</data>
  <data key="d39">comms_cyber_warfare</data>
</edge>
<edge source="global_oil_rebalance::chokepoint_disruption" target="iran_gulf_escalation::naval_deployment_lvl" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.9</data>
  <data key="d36">Observed increases in actual disruptions (attacks, seizures, delays) prompt flag states, commercial partners, and regional navies to surge patrols and escort missions to protect transits and reassure markets.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_oil_rebalance</data>
  <data key="d39">iran_gulf_escalation</data>
</edge>
<edge source="global_oil_rebalance::chokepoint_disruption" target="russia_ukraine_war::military_aid_flow" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Maritime chokepoint disruptions (delays, closures, re‑routing) directly slow or block sea shipments of heavy weapons, ammunition, and spare parts destined for Ukraine or its suppliers, reducing the rate at which military assistance can be delivered.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_oil_rebalance</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="global_oil_rebalance::chokepoint_disruption" target="transatlantic_cohesion::capital_flow_volatility" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Security incidents or delays at major maritime chokepoints shock energy and trade outlooks, triggering sudden portfolio rebalancing and stop‑loss moves that increase cross‑border capital‑flow volatility.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_oil_rebalance</data>
  <data key="d39">transatlantic_cohesion</data>
