  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Worsening market expectations about future oil availability raise the likelihood of unpredictable government interventions (strategic reserves releases, price caps, export controls), increasing perceived policy unpredictability among economic actors.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_oil_rebalance</data>
  <data key="d39">transatlantic_cohesion</data>
</edge>
