  <data key="d36">Higher utilization of compute infrastructure expands capacity for sophisticated, scalable cyber operations (AIS spoofing, ransomware, data-poisoning) and rapid incident evidence, prompting insurers to raise premiums and war-risk surcharges for affected routes.</data>
